  {"type":"TextWhitespace","value":"\n\n"},
  {"type":"CommentSingle","value":"; Reading and static errors happen before guard can run. For example,"},
  {"type":"TextWhitespace","value":"\n"},
  {"type":"CommentSingle","value":"; an unclosed parenthesis must be repaired in the source."},
  {"type":"TextWhitespace","value":"\n"},
  {"type":"CommentSingle","value":"; Resource termination is also distinct from a catchable runtime error."},
  {"type":"TextWhitespace","value":"\n\n"},
  {"type":"CommentSingle","value":"; Datum comments (#;) and #lang directives are not accepted."},
  {"type":"TextWhitespace","value":"\n"},
  {"type":"CommentSingle","value":"; Ordinary source execution is for trusted programs. Use the separate"},
  {"type":"TextWhitespace","value":"\n"},
  {"type":"CommentSingle","value":"; bounded evaluator interface for an application's explicit work and"},
  {"type":"TextWhitespace","value":"\n"},
  {"type":"CommentSingle","value":"; memory limits; the caller controls files, networking, and other actions."},
  {"type":"TextWhitespace","value":"\n"}
